                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "642b5995-1d0e-4efa-90d2-6745c4d92816",
                        "source_entry_id": "198810df-6387-32dc-864c-c988e89a6219",
                        "target_lang_word": "option",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "option",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcff310c-d338-3f6a-9e51-706afdd519a3",
                                        "entry_id": "60346ac8-08c9-35f4-85bd-7fdf19f4bf44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a set of choices that can be made."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39a60210-a6ea-4262-adf0-908cffca94c4",
                                                "sense_id": "dcff310c-d338-3f6a-9e51-706afdd519a3",
                                                "text": "Luiz struggled with the movement of Helguson in the box, as he collected a long ball and the Spaniard barged him over, leaving referee Chris Foy little option but to point to the spot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab3aeae3-6714-4052-a425-d017c2fe3c7f",
                                                "sense_id": "dcff310c-d338-3f6a-9e51-706afdd519a3",
                                                "text": "Libertarian paternalism is the view that, because the way options are presented to citizens affects what they choose, society should present options in a way that “nudges” our intuitive selves to make choices that are more consistent with what our more deliberative selves would have chosen if they were in control."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29eb01a4-0d74-3129-9741-3f431a4f20fb",
                                        "entry_id": "60346ac8-08c9-35f4-85bd-7fdf19f4bf44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The freedom or right to choose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ec36ab5-a90a-3081-b152-c169af014499",
                                        "entry_id": "60346ac8-08c9-35f4-85bd-7fdf19f4bf44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A contract giving the holder the right to buy or sell an asset at a set strike price; can apply to financial market transactions, or to ordinary transactions for tangible assets such as a residence or automobile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "062d9b35-fe16-438e-bca0-3d568904f1da",
                                                "sense_id": "8ec36ab5-a90a-3081-b152-c169af014499",
                                                "text": "There's a book out on us and there's gonna be a movie based on the book. ABC has bought the option for a movie to be made specially for T.V."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f0961f4-4ccb-3d69-b6ab-59f41b45adec",
                                        "entry_id": "60346ac8-08c9-35f4-85bd-7fdf19f4bf44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The acquiring or retention of a nationality through personal choice as a right, bypassing selective legal mechanisms for naturalization, especially in cases where a territory is transferred or passed on from one state to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2d0ff85-c0b1-4a60-a046-7306a67ce35f",
                                                "sense_id": "8f0961f4-4ccb-3d69-b6ab-59f41b45adec",
                                                "text": "At that time every emigrant who was made aware of such a notification submitted his application for option to the British Consuls within the period prescribed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f73b9779-4909-4200-842f-743d7ed3da90",
                                                "sense_id": "8f0961f4-4ccb-3d69-b6ab-59f41b45adec",
                                                "text": "A right of option, mostly in favour of the nationality of the predecessor State, has been accorded in most cases of partial State succession, either by treaty or by domestic legislation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84bceb2e-1aa3-4aed-b62a-ad1eb5dab28c",
                                                "sense_id": "8f0961f4-4ccb-3d69-b6ab-59f41b45adec",
                                                "text": "This group constitutes around 9 percent of the total number of acquisitions of Dutch nationality through option."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "option",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cd0b55f-e733-362b-8615-5dae634a009b",
                                        "entry_id": "f9701fc5-ec53-3384-aca0-f121a123ca84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To purchase an option on something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eff3b98c-0e59-4a34-aafe-b965566e4a1b",
                                                "sense_id": "6cd0b55f-e733-362b-8615-5dae634a009b",
                                                "text": "The new novel was optioned by the film studio, but they'll probably never decide to make a movie from it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c110c8f-93b0-36cf-95d7-7523103f43a1",
                                        "entry_id": "f9701fc5-ec53-3384-aca0-f121a123ca84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To configure, by setting an option."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de5ed9d6-2a9f-40a0-ae63-4fcdb10cb5f3",
                                                "sense_id": "9c110c8f-93b0-36cf-95d7-7523103f43a1",
                                                "text": "The device that is to echo the characters should be optioned for echoplexing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
